            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An assembly comprising a body 50 defining an aperture 52, and an electrode 10 comprising a portion 54 within the aperture 52, the assembly further comprising a lead 12 comprising a section 56 which is secured inside the aperture 52 by a first interference fit between the body 50 and the portion 54 of the electrode 10. The aperture 52 may comprise a first open end 58 and a second open end 60, wherein the electrode 10 extends through the first open end 58, and the lead 12 extends through the second open end 60. In which case, the electrode 10 may plug the first end 58 by a second interference fit between the body 50 and the portion 54 of the electrode 10. The portion 54 of the electrode 12 may comprise a tapered section 62 against which the section 56 of the lead 12 is secured.</p>
            </abstract>
